                "options": {
                    "systemMessage": "=You are creating a cinematic viral short video.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nDo NOT generate any text, letters, words, logos, signs, captions, or readable typography inside the video.\nAll text will be added later in post-production.\nKeep clean dark areas suitable for overlay.\n\nScene 1 (0-3s):\nClose-up cinematic shot of an old law book opening slowly on a wooden desk.\nDust particles floating in warm golden light.\nCamera slowly pushes forward.\nMood: mysterious, professional, intellectual.\nLeave empty space in the center for future text overlay.\n\nScene 2 (3-7s):\nBeat drop transition.\nFast cinematic montage:\nA drone flies above a modern law institute building with glass architecture.\nCamera sweeps through a premium legal library.\nLaw professionals in formal suits discuss around a futuristic meeting table.\nSmooth gimbal movement.\nNo visible signs or text anywhere.\n\nScene 3 (7-12s):\nClose-up of a legal expert's eyes reflecting abstract digital data.\nCamera pulls back revealing the expert standing confidently in front of a city skyline at night.\nCinematic blue lighting.\nLeave clean empty space for logo placement later.\n\nStyle:\nUltra realistic documentary film.\nHollywood cinematic lighting.\n4K.\nVertical 9:16.\nProfessional commercial quality.\nNo text generation.\nNo logos.\nNo letters."
                }
            },
